---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
import { integrations } from '@/integrations/config';
---
<Layout title="Privacy information" description="How the Mindlab website handles inquiries, scheduling, and optional analytics.">
  <section class="page-hero container"><p class="eyebrow">Your information</p><h1>Privacy, in plain language.</h1><p class="lede">This page describes the tools enabled on this website and how information moves through them.</p></section>
  <section class="section section-compact"><div class="container reading-width privacy-copy"><h2>Who operates this site</h2><p>Mindlab Solutions operates this marketing website.{integrations.contactEmail && <> For questions about your information, contact <a href={`mailto:${integrations.contactEmail}`}>{integrations.contactEmail}</a>.</>}</p>
    <h2>Information you choose to share</h2>{integrations.leadCapture ? <p>Our inquiry form is provided by Tally. It asks for your name, email, company, and primary goal, with optional context about your website, audience, service interest, and budget. We use responses to assess fit and respond to your inquiry. Avoid including sensitive information. Tally processes and stores submissions through its service. <a href="https://tally.so/help/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tally privacy policy</a>.</p> : <p>This draft website does not currently collect inquiry form submissions.</p>}
    {integrations.contactEmail && <p>If you email us, we use your message and contact details to respond and discuss the work you have asked about.</p>}
    <h2>Scheduling</h2>{integrations.booking ? <p>The booking button opens an external scheduling service. That service handles the booking details you provide, including your contact information and chosen time. Review the privacy information on the booking page before submitting.</p> : <p>A booking calendar is not currently connected to this draft website.</p>}
    <h2>Analytics and cookies</h2>{integrations.analytics ? <p>Optional analytics are delivered through Google Tag Manager only after you choose Allow analytics. Your preference is stored in your browser. The site sends a limited set of interaction events, such as package interest and booking-link clicks; it does not send inquiry field contents through that event wrapper. You can change your choice using Cookie preferences in the footer. <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google privacy policy</a>.</p> : <p>Optional analytics are not enabled on this version of the website. We do not load Google Tag Manager or Google Analytics.</p>}
    <h2>Technical information</h2><p>Your browser sends technical information, such as an IP address and requested page, to the service hosting the website. That service may process access and security logs. External inquiry or scheduling tools receive technical information when you open them.</p>
    <h2>Your choices</h2><p>Share only the information needed for the conversation. You can choose whether to use external forms and booking tools.{integrations.contactEmail && <> To ask about access, correction, or deletion of information you shared with Mindlab, contact <a href={`mailto:${integrations.contactEmail}`}>{integrations.contactEmail}</a>. We will review the request and any applicable recordkeeping requirements.</>}</p>
    {integrations.stage !== 'production' && <p class="sample-notice">Draft for review before launch. Business contact details, the hosting provider, enabled tools, and retention practices must be confirmed before this becomes the production privacy notice.</p>}
  </div></section>
</Layout>
